    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really want to go back to the doctor for something this small lol. plus i heard st johns wort is just a natural herb so it's usually pretty safe and doesn't have much side effects. are you sure it's actually that big of a deal? can i just take a low dose to be safe?",
